orrect**.\n\nBased on a detailed analysis of the provided frames, there are **four distinct judges** visible across the video. Here is the evidence:\n\n---\n\n### 1. **Wide shots of the judges’ panel (Frames 2, 7, 8, 16, 17, 18, 28, 29):**\n\n- **Frames 2, 7, 8:** Show a wide view of the judges’ table with **four individuals** seated side-by-side: from left to right, a man in a suit (David Walliams), a woman with blonde hair (Amanda Holden), a woman in green (Alesha Dixon), and Simon Cowell.\n  \n- **Frames 16, 17, 18:** Show the same four judges in a different configuration, but still clearly four people: David Walliams, Amanda Holden, Alesha Dixon, and Simon Cowell.\n\n- **Frames 28, 29:** A wide-angle shot of the entire stage and judges’ table. The names above the judges’ chairs are clearly visible: **SIMON, AMANDA, ALESHA, DAVID** — confirming **four judges**.\n\n---\n\n### 2. **Close-up shots of individual judges (Frames 1, 3, 4, 9, 10, 11, 12, 19, 20, 21, 26, 27):**\n\n- **Simon Cowell** appears in multiple frames (1, 3, 4, 9, 11, 12, 20, 21, 26, 27).\n- **David Walliams** is visible in Frames 10 and 19.\n- **Amanda Holden** is visible in Frames 11 and 12 (seated next to Simon).\n- **Alesha Dixon** is visible in Frames 16–18 (center-right in the panel).\n\nThese are not the same person — they are clearly different individuals with distinct appearances and seating positions.\n\n---\n\n### 3. **Judges’ table setup:**\n\n- The table has **four chairs**, **four microphones**, and **four nameplates** (as seen in Frames 28–29).\n- Each judge is shown reacting independently to performances (e.g., Amanda Holden smiling, David Walliams laughing, Simon Cowell looking serious or amused).\n\n---\n\n### 4. **Temporal consistency:**\n\n- Across multiple frames and time points (e.g., early frames like 2 and later frames like 28), the same four judges are consistently present.\n- No frame shows only one judge at the table — even when the camera zooms in on Simon Cowell, the context of the full panel is maintained in other frames.\n\n---\n\n### Conclusion:\n\nThe video clearly shows **four judges**: Simon Cowell, Amanda Holden, Alesha Dixon, and David Walliams. The answer '1' is therefore **incorrect**.\n\n✅ **Correct answer: 4 judges.**"}, {'batch_start': 120, 'batch_end': 150, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1243.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1244.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1245.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_1246.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_2423.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_2424.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_2425.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_2426.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_2427.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_2428.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_2429.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_2430.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_2431.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_2432.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_2433.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_2558.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_2559.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_2560.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_2561.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_2562.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_2563.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/vZV2WCKMsKs/frames/frame_2564.jpg', '/m